     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "Another way employers can ensure work is done is to make sure each worker who telecommutes signs a written policy of what their expectations are for the position."
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "An employer can communicate clear expectations and then regularly check the employee’s successful completion of tasks according to specifications."
    }
